 "pages": [
  {
   "slug": "principles",
   "title": "Principles",
   "html": "<div class=\"tmt-design-docs\"><article class=\"docs-article\"><h1>Principles</h1><p class=\"docs-lead\">Short rules that decide most questions before they come up.</p><ol class=\"docs-principles\"><li><h2>Red is rare</h2><p>The ninja retains its canonical pale ink on a dark tile. Accent red marks keyboard focus, the selected tab and the one primary action on a surface. Nothing else is red-filled.</p></li><li><h2>Status is never the accent</h2><p>Working, waiting, review and blocked have their own muted hues and always a mark and a word (● ◆ ◐ ✕). Blocked is a darker red with its ✕, never the accent.</p></li><li><h2>Corners are small</h2><p>Controls, fields and tags share one radius; cards and surfaces are one step larger. Only avatars and status dots are round.</p></li><li><h2>Real components only</h2><p>A mock is built from the same components the product ships, so a mock is the implementation and review compares like with like.</p></li><li><h2>One family</h2><p>One set of components and tokens serves Colab, Remote, Ops and the blog. Product code adds no colours, radii or local copies.</p></li></ol></article></div>",
   "path": "principles"
  },
  {
   "slug": "work",
   "title": "Work home",
   "html": "<div class=\"tmt-design-docs\"><article class=\"docs-article\"><h1>Work home</h1><p class=\"docs-lead\">The Work home parts: the work row, the status overview and ratio bar, the done-count chart, project order drag handle and Next line, and the field chips of a page title row.</p><p class=\"docs-muted\">Styles: src/work.css, src/avatar.css, in the shared static.css.</p><h2>Variants and states</h2><div class=\"docs-browser-demo\"><section class=\"gallery-section\" id=\"work\" aria-labelledby=\"work-title\"><h2 id=\"work-title\">Work home</h2><div class=\"gallery-pair\"><h3>Order drag handle</h3><p class=\"gallery-note\">Drag a ranked Work item to its new position.</p><div class=\"gallery-columns\"><div class=\"gallery-column\" data-theme=\"light\"><span class=\"gallery-theme-label\">light</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-grip\" draggable=\"true\" title=\"Move item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-grip-vertical\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"5\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"19\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"5\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"19\" r=\"1\"></circle></svg></span></div><div class=\"gallery-column\" data-theme=\"dark\"><span class=\"gallery-theme-label\">dark</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-grip\" draggable=\"true\" title=\"Move item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-grip-vertical\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"5\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"19\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"5\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"19\" r=\"1\"></circle></svg></span></div></div></div><div class=\"gallery-pair\"><h3>Order rank</h3><p class=\"gallery-note\">Position in the project’s Next list.</p><div class=\"gallery-columns\"><div class=\"gallery-column\" data-theme=\"light\"><span class=\"gallery-theme-label\">light</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-rank\">1</span></div><div class=\"gallery-column\" data-theme=\"dark\"><span class=\"gallery-theme-label\">dark</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-rank\">1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"gallery-pair\"><h3>Next line</h3><p class=\"gallery-note\">The first three ranked items below a project.</p><div class=\"gallery-columns\"><div class=\"gallery-column\" data-theme=\"light\"><span class=\"gallery-theme-label\">light</span><p class=\"tmt-ui-work-next-line\"><strong>Next</strong> <span>Title fields → Computed status → Work home</span></p></div><div class=\"gallery-column\" data-theme=\"dark\"><span class=\"gallery-theme-label\">dark</span><p class=\"tmt-ui-work-next-line\"><strong>Next</strong> <span>Title fields → Computed status → Work home</span></p></div></div></div><div class=\"gallery-pair\"><h3>Work row</h3><p class=\"gallery-note\">One work item in a project section: status dot, number, priority and title, next step, owner and time since its last activity. Under the compact width the title leads and the number, owner and time share a last line.</p><div class=\"gallery-columns\" data-stacked=\"true\"><div class=\"gallery-column\" data-theme=\"light\"><span class=\"gallery-theme-label\">light</span><div><a class=\"tmt-ui-work-row\" href=\"#work\"><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-dot\" data-state=\"blocked\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-number\">COLAB-119</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-title\"><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-priority\">High</span>Batch reads for large design pages</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-next\">Blocked: waiting for Core to decide the protocol</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-owner\"><span class=\"tmt-ui-avatar\" data-kind=\"agent\" data-size=\"s\" aria-hidden=\"true\">G2</span><span>gui-2</span></span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-time\">1 day</span></a><a class=\"tmt-ui-work-row\" href=\"#work\"><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-dot\" data-state=\"needs-you\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-number\">COLAB-140</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-title\"><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-priority\">High</span>A Colab page is the work</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-next\">Needs you: answer 4 questions</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-owner\"><span class=\"tmt-ui-avatar\" data-kind=\"agent\" data-size=\"s\" aria-hidden=\"true\">TG</span><span>tmt-gui-lead</span></span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-time\">10 min</span></a><a class=\"tmt-ui-work-row\" href=\"#work\"><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-dot\" data-state=\"working\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-number\">COLAB-143</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-title\">Mockup toolbar has no spacing</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-next\">PR #6470 in review</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-owner\"><span class=\"tmt-ui-avatar\" data-kind=\"agent\" data-size=\"s\" aria-hidden=\"true\">G3</span><span>gui-3</span></span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-time\">3 min</span></a><a class=\"tmt-ui-work-row\" href=\"#work\"><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-dot\" data-state=\"possibly-stalled\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-number\">OPS-37</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-title\">Delete the timing-only tests</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-next\">Possibly stalled: idle 3 hours, asked once</span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-owner\"><span class=\"tmt-ui-avatar\" data-kind=\"agent\" data-size=\"s\" aria-hidden=\"true\">G3</span><span>gui-3</span></span><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-time\">3 h</span></a><a class=\"tmt-ui-work-row\" href=\"#work\"><span class=\"tmt-ui-work-dot\" data-state=\"waiting-ci\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><spa